  "description": "Do you know who you want to be, or do you discover it? For Millie, between dead-end jobs and a passionless relationship, she hasn’t even had the time to wonder. But things are about to change when she is offered a temporary place to stay and meets Finn, her handsome new housemate. Struggling against their sensuous chemistry, Millie strives to do what she thinks is right… but resisting temptation is never easy. Will Millie keep fighting against what she wants? Or will she finally let her passions guide her?\nSource: Webtoon",
